移除我的页面推广 = type=http-response, pattern=^https://zgrb\.epicc\.com\.cn/G-HAPP/mpageconfig/myPageConfigList/v3, script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CodeApe-Xiaoyin/loon-plugins/kelee-snapshot-2026-11-10/vendor/kelee/resources/kelee.one/Resource/JavaScript/PICC_Insurance/PICC_Insurance_remove_ads.js, requires-body=1

